                        Ministers of Foreign Affairs of the American Republics, Habana, July 21–30,
                        1940, Report of the Secretary of State</hi> (Washington, Government Printing
                    Office, 1941), p. 68.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d631-f3" n="25" xml:id="d631-f3-content">
